    "detailed_description": "<strong>Maximus Mouse is back!</strong><br>Experience manic arcade action set across loads of game modes. Classic arcade gameplay with many twists and surprises awaits you!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2>Those pesky cats have stolen Max's retirement fund!  Pursue them around the world to get it back, but watch out for surprises along the way!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Party!</h2>Grab three of your friends for some couch mayhem!  Stay alive, grab those coins and capture those cheeses! Use power ups to your advantage, but beware - anything can happen: laser attacks, high winds, and lemon hitmen are just a few of the events you'll face. <br><br>Oh, and do keep an eye out for that walrus!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trials</h2>Pit your wits against the cats across 50+ trials. Quick, bite-sized challenges to test any mouse!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Arcade</h2>Try your hand at the arcade modes and beat those scores!",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Maximus Mouse is back!</strong><br>Experience manic arcade action set across loads of game modes. Classic arcade gameplay with many twists and surprises awaits you!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2>Those pesky cats have stolen Max's retirement fund!  Pursue them around the world to get it back, but watch out for surprises along the way!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Party!</h2>Grab three of your friends for some couch mayhem!  Stay alive, grab those coins and capture those cheeses! Use power ups to your advantage, but beware - anything can happen: laser attacks, high winds, and lemon hitmen are just a few of the events you'll face. <br><br>Oh, and do keep an eye out for that walrus!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trials</h2>Pit your wits against the cats across 50+ trials. Quick, bite-sized challenges to test any mouse!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Arcade</h2>Try your hand at the arcade modes and beat those scores!",
    "short_description": "Maximus Mouse is back! Experience Manic Mayhem across Story, Arcade &amp; Trial modes. Or grab some friends for party mode!",
